<%-include('../partials/user/header') %>

<body>
        <%-include('../partials/user/navbar') %>

       <div class="about-page">
        
    <section class="hero">
        <img src="/public/images/about us Head.jpg" 
             alt="Elegant organized wardrobe display" class="hero-bg">
        <div class="hero-overlay"></div>
        <div class="hero-content">
            <h1>About Us</h1>
            <p>Crafting Style, Defining Elegance</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <div class="container">
        <div class="intro">
            <h2>Welcome to MONTRÉA</h2>
            <p>Where timeless elegance meets contemporary style. We believe that fashion is more than just clothing—it's an expression of who you are. Our carefully curated collection brings you premium quality apparel that seamlessly blends sophistication with everyday comfort.</p>
            <p>Founded on the principles of quality craftsmanship and accessible luxury, MONTRÉA has become a trusted destination for discerning shoppers who refuse to compromise on style or quality.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="stats-section">
            <div class="stat-item">
                <div class="stat-number">10K+</div>
                <div class="stat-label">Happy Customers</div>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-item">
                <div class="stat-number">500+</div>
                <div class="stat-label">Products</div>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-item">
                <div class="stat-number">50+</div>
                <div class="stat-label">Cities</div>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-item">
                <div class="stat-number">4.8★</div>
                <div class="stat-label">Customer Rating</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <section class="values-section">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="intro">
                <h2>Our Values</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="values-grid">
                <div class="value-card">
                    <div class="value-icon">✦</div>
                    <h3>Quality First</h3>
                    <p>Every piece in our collection is selected with meticulous attention to fabric quality, craftsmanship, and durability. We believe in clothing that lasts.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="value-card">
                    <div class="value-icon">◆</div>
                    <h3>Timeless Style</h3>
                    <p>We curate fashion that transcends fleeting trends. Our designs are versatile, elegant, and built to remain relevant season after season.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="value-card">
                    <div class="value-icon">●</div>
                    <h3>Customer Focused</h3>
                    <p>Your satisfaction is our priority. From browsing to delivery, we're committed to providing an exceptional shopping experience every step of the way.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <div class="container">
        <div class="story-section">
            <div class="story-content">
                <h2>Our Story</h2>
                <p>MONTRÉA was born from a passion for creating accessible luxury fashion. We recognized the need for a brand that offers sophisticated, high-quality clothing without the premium price tag.</p>
                <p>Our journey began with a simple mission: to make elegant fashion accessible to everyone who appreciates quality and style. Today, we serve thousands of satisfied customers who trust us for their wardrobe essentials.</p>
                <p>From crisp formal shirts to casual everyday wear, each piece in our collection is chosen to help you look and feel your best, whether you're heading to the office or enjoying a casual weekend.</p>
                <p>We partner with skilled manufacturers who share our commitment to excellence, ensuring every stitch, button, and seam meets our exacting standards.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="story-image">
                <img src="/public/images/about us OS.jpg" 
                     alt="Premium shirts hanging neatly">
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mission-vision">
            <div class="mission-box">
                <h3>Our Mission</h3>
                <p>To provide high-quality, stylish clothing that empowers individuals to express themselves confidently while maintaining affordability and accessibility for all.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="vision-box">
                <h3>Our Vision</h3>
                <p>To become the leading choice for fashion-conscious individuals seeking the perfect balance between timeless elegance, contemporary trends, and exceptional value.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <section class="cta-section">
        <div class="container">
            <h2>Start Your Style Journey</h2>
            <p>Discover our latest collection and find pieces that speak to your personal style.</p>
            <a href="/shop" class="cta-button">Shop Now</a>
        </div>
    </section>
</div>
    <%- include('../partials/user/footer') %>
